    "chapter": "Character Creation",
    "section": "2.38",
    "heading": "Experience Points",
    "lineStart": 1289,
    "lineEnd": 1291
  },
  "section": "2.38",
  "rulesText": "The Experience Point cost to gain a level is based on your total character level, not your level in a particular class, as shown in the Character Advancement table in “Character Creation.” For example, if you are a level 6 Cleric / level 1 Fighter, you must gain enough XP to reach level 8 before you can take your second level as a Fighter or your seventh level as a Cleric."
}
